      "id": "spring-boot-overview",
      "heading": "Spring Boot Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Definition:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Spring Boot is a Spring project that provides a simplified, rapid development approach to creating Spring-based applications. It uses convention over configuration and provides production-ready features with minimal setup."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Purpose:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "To help developers quickly build standalone, production-grade Spring applications without extensive configuration."
        },
        {
